{"id":"prueba","lemma":"prueba","pos":"noun","rank":417,"glosses":["proof; evidence (usually in the plural)","an examination, test, or quiz","a trial; an ordeal; an audition"],"ipa":"/ˈpɾweba/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"pruebas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/ec/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Millars-prueba.wav","examples":[{"text":"Venga, prueba otra vez.","en":"OK, try again.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/850172"},{"text":"¿Qué pruebas tiene usted?","en":"Where's your proof?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/704948"},{"text":"Prueba dándole una patada.","en":"Try kicking it.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/850189"},{"text":"¿Por qué no pruebas esto?","en":"Why don't you try this one?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/196018"},{"text":"Prueba con otra distinta.","en":"Try another one.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/850199"}]}